Begin3
Title:           XDPC Pascal Compiler
Version:         0.7.14
Entered-date:    2023-03-31
Description:     small educational Pascal compiler
Summary:		 XDPC is a small educational compiler for a subset of the Pascal language. A native x86 machine code generator directly emits EXE executables for MS-DOS. The compiler supports VGA graphics, floating-point arithmetic, etc. 32-bit Pascal source is provided.
Keywords:        pas turbo pascal xdp xdpc
Author:          Vasiliy Tereshkov
Maintained-by:   DosWorld
Primary-site:    https://github.com/DosWorld/xdpc
Platforms:       DOS
Copying-policy:  MIT-0 (Public Domain)
End
